&lt;li&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@leak-doctor/shared" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;@leak-doctor/shared&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; — Shared Diagnostic Schemas &amp;amp; Formatters&lt;/li&gt;
